{"d36bea9f-853f-4908-9957-5514b1903e36":{"id":"d36bea9f-853f-4908-9957-5514b1903e36","title":"Marika-chan no Koukando wa Bukkowareteiru","altTitle":"Marika-chan's Affection Meter is Completely Broken","description":"Aku tiba-tiba bisa melihat tingkat rasa suka dari gadis yang kusukai.──Aku tidak punya keberanian untuk menyatakan cinta pada teman masa kecilku, Marika-chan. Suatu hari, aku membuat permohonan yang sangat kuat pada bintang jatuh: \"Aku berharap bisa memahami perasaan orang lain, seperti di dalam game romansa.\" Dan ternyata, permohonan itu terkabul...!?\n\nDi atas kepala para gadis di kelasku, muncul status bar yang menunjukkan rasa suka. Dalam kebingunganku melihat pemandangan aneh ini, aku memutuskan untuk memeriksa status barnya Marika-chan. Namun, status barnya justru melebihi batas, berubah menjadi status bar \"neraka\" yang benar-benar kacau...!?\n\nMarika-chan, kalau kau tidak menyukaiku, kenapa kau begitu baik padaku...?\n──Apa rahasia sebenarnya di balik sikap Marika-chan yang manis dan menggemaskan? Apakah dia benar-benar membenciku!? Atau mungkin sebenarnya...!?","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d36bea9f-853f-4908-9957-5514b1903e36/4b5daf86-5fc1-4316-ba94-cb96f093bd89.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["uk","es-la","en","pt-br","vi","th","id","ar","tr","fr"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.47,"follows":76724,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:15.312Z","chapters":[{"id":"6ed5c243-a2f7-4263-b6d0-c3da7e06eda0","number":"25","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T10:44:38+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d631399f-5cb5-4961-baad-5fbf20c799c4","number":"24","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T10:43:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"33f2d411-985e-4dfe-ac3e-0b9bc3b6c8ad","number":"23","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"create