ad who's traveled back in time keeps preventing her death.\n\nDana is a side character destined to die in order for the leading couple, Arcane and Stella, to become happy. So, to get back to my original world, I have to do my best to fulfill my role...! But, why is the male lead so obsessed with me all of a sudden? And why do I get the feeling he's purposely going against the flow of the original...?\n\n\"I won't let you die again because of me, Dana\"\n\n---\n\n>Offical Translations:\n- [English <NetComics>](https://www.netcomics.com/en/comic/for-stella)\n- [Japanese <Comico>](https://www.comico.jp/comic/1178)\n- [Chinese (ZH) <Webtoons>](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/western-palace/for-stella/list?title_no=5013)","year":2021,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/289738ab-806f-4f5c-8bbd-778c3f64c9cb/7934c616-88a3-470b-946c-5676e1555899.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","pl","pt-br"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":6.96,"follows":665,"listAt":"2026-10-23T18:59:25.740Z","chapters":[{"id":"451e85a6-e6df-47f6-b989-9206c04446ae","number":"7","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":29,"createdAt":"2022-02-20T03:59:10+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ca80019d-c923-410d-8971-9c994083264a","number":"6","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2022-02-20T03:56:54+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"83fc7a2a-9dd7-466d-a560-87ac9d3d8c26","number":"5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":30,"createdAt":"2022-02-20T03:56:09+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8247b4bd-a89d-4e91-a259-08bfebcdf20e","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2022-02-20T03:55:36+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6cf90409-f9fd-4835-bd73-c14e28eaea68","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":29,"createdAt":"2022-02-20T03:55:13+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"37c7ce86-8a19-4c3e-9514-68ff806ed6